00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,020
Woman: I just replaced my mobile phones battery

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,575
but I'm still having trouble with it.

3
00:00:07,575 --> 00:00:11,110
Didn't you replace your phone's battery recently?

4
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:14,170
Man: I did. Mine works fine now.

5
